CREATE TABLE "TransportFeePlan" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"code" TEXT NOT NULL,"billingCycle" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'MONTHLY',"amount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'INR',"routeId" TEXT,"academicYear" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ACTIVE',"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeePlan_schoolId_code_key" ON "TransportFeePlan"("schoolId","code");
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeePlan_org_school_status_year_idx" ON "TransportFeePlan"("organizationId","schoolId","status","academicYear");
CREATE TABLE "TransportFeeInvoice" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"studentId" TEXT NOT NULL,"allocationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"planId" TEXT,"invoiceNumber" TEXT NOT NULL,"billingPeriod" TEXT NOT NULL,"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'INR',"grossAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,"discountAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"waiverAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"netAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,"amountPaid" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"amountDue" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,"dueAt" DATE,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ISSUED',"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"issuedBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"issuedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeeInvoice_id_organizationId_schoolId_key" ON "TransportFeeInvoice"("id","organizationId","schoolId");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeeInvoice_schoolId_invoiceNumber_key" ON "TransportFeeInvoice"("schoolId","invoiceNumber");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeeInvoice_allocationId_billingPeriod_key" ON "TransportFeeInvoice"("allocationId","billingPeriod");
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeeInvoice_org_school_student_status_due_idx" ON "TransportFeeInvoice"("organizationId","schoolId","studentId","status","dueAt");
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeeInvoice_org_school_period_idx" ON "TransportFeeInvoice"("organizationId","schoolId","billingPeriod");
CREATE TABLE "TransportFeePayment" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"invoiceId" TEXT NOT NULL,"studentId" TEXT NOT NULL,"amount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL,"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'INR',"method" TEXT NOT NULL,"reference" TEXT NOT NULL,"receiptNumber" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'RECORDED',"paidAt" DATE NOT NULL,"recordedBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "TransportFeePayment_invoiceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("invoiceId","organizationId","schoolId") REFERENCES "TransportFeeInvoice"("id","organizationId","schoolId") ON DELETE RESTRICT);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeePayment_schoolId_reference_key" ON "TransportFeePayment"("schoolId","reference");
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeePayment_org_school_student_paid_idx" ON "TransportFeePayment"("organizationId","schoolId","studentId","paidAt");
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeePayment_org_school_invoice_idx" ON "TransportFeePayment"("organizationId","schoolId","invoiceId");

CREATE TABLE "TransportFeeAdjustment" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"invoiceId" TEXT NOT NULL,"studentId" TEXT NOT NULL,"discountAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"waiverAmount" DECIMAL(12,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"reason" VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL,"recordedBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "TransportFeeAdjustment_invoiceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("invoiceId","organizationId","schoolId") REFERENCES "TransportFeeInvoice"("id","organizationId","schoolId") ON DELETE RESTRICT);
CREATE INDEX "TransportFeeAdjustment_org_school_invoice_created_idx" ON "TransportFeeAdjustment"("organizationId","schoolId","invoiceId","createdAt");

CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "TransportFeePayment_schoolId_receiptNumber_key" ON "TransportFeePayment"("schoolId","receiptNumber");
